---
// Shown whenever the report renders bundled fixture data rather than a real
// audit. Being unmistakable about this matters more than being subtle.
---

<aside
  aria-labelledby="sample-data-heading"
  class="rounded-lg border-2 border-amber-500 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-amber-950"
>
  <h2 id="sample-data-heading" class="font-semibold">Sample data</h2>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm">
    This page is rendering built-in fixture data, not a real audit. Run an audit and rebuild with
    <code class="rounded bg-amber-100 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">ALLY_AUDIT_FILE</code> pointing at
    an <code class="rounded bg-amber-100 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">audit.json</code> to see real
    results.
  </p>
</aside>
